  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_can_cb5c9aadb68d5b8bad9223335c8b8731de59ac3e9af2b91a82a70711f25fe9048e">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a vessel for holding liquids; formerly used of vessels of various materials, shapes, and sizes, including drinking-vessels; mostly larger than a drinking-vessel, and usually cylindrical in form, with a handle over the top (OED s.v. can n.1 1a)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
